  "_comment": "docs/02 §2.3 in JSON. status: proposed | running | halted | ended. composition: pareto | oec | frontier (oec requires oec_weights: {metric_id: weight}; frontier needs two or more goals that trade off and keeps an archive of non-dominated members, one branch each, instead of one line of commits: docs/02 §2.3, docs/06 §6.9). mode: optimize | instrument (instrument inverts frozen and protected roles per docs/07 §7.3). walls are the five walls of docs/04 plus the pre-registration, anomaly-breaker, and paired-confirmation checks; every one defaults to true and turning one off is recorded in the ledger and the report. Placeholders in {{...}} are filled at gate 1; the harness rejects a campaign that still contains one.",
